+# CAST BLACK DIALOG — V100.0.150
+
+Change is source-only. No APK/Gradle/GitHub build was run.
+
+## Change
+The app-wide `Theme.SE` now supplies `mediaRouteTheme` pointing to `Theme.SE.MediaRouter`.
+The custom MediaRouter theme forces a black dialog/window background and white text, and increases
+primary cast-route text to 16sp. Header/body text appearances are also overridden for consistency.
+
+This applies to the standard AndroidX MediaRouter chooser used by the Google Cast `MediaRouteButton`
+flow in PlayerActivity (Movies, Series episodes, Live) and TvModeActivity (Live).
+
+Google Cast routing/discovery logic is unchanged.
