@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+# CAST BLACK DIALOG — V100.0.151
+
+Source-only verification after the requested version increment.
+
+## Verified change 1 — Cast chooser appearance
+- `Theme.SE` points `mediaRouteTheme` to `Theme.SE.MediaRouter`.
+- `Theme.SE.MediaRouter` uses a black window/background (`#000000`) and white text.
+- Primary route text is `16sp`; secondary/header/body text is also explicitly styled.
+- `MediaRouteButton` is used by `PlayerActivity` for Movies and Series playback and by `TvModeActivity` for Live.
+- Google Cast routing/discovery code was not changed by this visual update.
+
+## Verified change 2 — Series player selection
+- `btnPlayerForSeries` opens a selection dialog and does not start playback.
+- `SE PLAYER` saves the choice for the current series.
+- `OPEN WITH` enumerates installed external video players, saves the selected package for the current series, and does not start playback.
+- Episode Play uses the saved series-specific player; the selected external package is launched explicitly.
+- The preference key is scoped by active profile + series ID.
+- The series player-selection dialogs use the black `Theme.SE.SeriesPlayerDialog`.
+
+## Version
+- `versionCode`: `1000151`
+- `versionName`: `100.0.151`
+- `settings.gradle` root project name: `SEAndroid_v100.0.151`
+
+No APK/Gradle/GitHub build was run.
