+# V100.0.154 — Downloads PLAY chooser audit
+
+- Base: V100.0.153
+- Version: 100.0.154 / 100.0.154
+- No Gradle/GitHub build performed.
+
+## Requested behavior
+Downloads > PLAY now opens a black `PLAY WITH` dialog with:
+1. SE PLAYER — opens the downloaded URI in the internal SE player.
+2. OPEN WITH — opens the Android system video-player chooser so the user can select any installed compatible player.
+
+## Safety / URI handling
+- PLAY remains disabled unless the download is COMPLETED and the URI is available.
+- External player intent carries `FLAG_GRANT_READ_URI_PERMISSION`, allowing compatible apps to read MediaStore/content URIs.
+- MIME type is inferred from the downloaded filename through `PublicMediaStorage.mimeForName()`.
+
+## Static checks
+- `versionCode 1000154` present.
+- `versionName "100.0.154"` present.
+- `playDownloadedFile()` contains both `SE PLAYER` and `OPEN WITH` branches.
+- External branch uses `Intent.ACTION_VIEW`, `video/*`-compatible MIME, and `Intent.createChooser`.
+- No build executed.
