@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# V100.0.155 — Recordings Play Chooser Audit
+
+Requested change: the PLAY button in Records/Recordings must show a choice between SE PLAYER and OPEN WITH, matching Downloads behavior.
+
+## Changes
+- RecordingsActivity.playRecording() now opens a black PLAY WITH dialog.
+- SE PLAYER launches the local recording through PlayerLauncher using the internal GENC_MEDIA3 player.
+- OPEN WITH launches Android's external video-player chooser with the recording content URI and read grant.
+- Recording MIME type is inferred using PublicMediaStorage.mimeForName().
+- CANCEL leaves playback untouched.
+- Existing recording availability checks remain in place.
+- Version bumped from 100.0.154 to 100.0.155.
+
+## Build status
+No Gradle/GitHub build was run. Static source inspection only.
